# Python Conventions

## Pydantic v2
- Use `model_config = ConfigDict(...)` not `class Config`
- Use `@field_validator` not `@validator`
- Use `model_dump()` not `.dict()`
- Annotate all fields with types

## httpx patterns
- Always use `httpx.Client` as a context manager
- Set explicit timeouts: `httpx.Client(timeout=30.0)`
- Carry cookies across requests via the client session (do not extract/re-inject manually)

## CSV parsing
- Always use `csv.DictReader` — never split on commas manually
- Keep `ID_VOTER` and `source_election_id` as strings

## Async
- Core scraping functions use `asyncio` + `httpx.AsyncClient`
- CLI entry points use `asyncio.run()`

## Ruff
- Line length: 100
- Target: Python 3.10+
- Selected rules: E, W, F, I (isort), UP (pyupgrade)
